## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Alexandr-Wang.md`

### Central Thesis
Wang's whole identity is a placement on someone else's scoreboard — he "snuck in" fourth of four — so he built the machine that decides whose judgment qualifies, and when the field's highest authority ranked him and found him short, the charge landed because it agreed with him.

